div.p:
As will have been seen, Mondoñedo is a city without history, and without a past; doubtless it will for ever remain a village without a future. Its doings, its raison
                     {97}
                       d'être, are summed up in the cathedral that stands in its centre, just as in Santiago, though from different motives.

